WEBVTT

00:00:56.969 --> 00:01:01.015
Pursuing profit alone comes
at the expense of future adaptation.

00:01:01.057 --> 00:01:04.310
But long-term investment alone
ignores present needs.

00:01:04.685 --> 00:01:06.020
Both are essential,

00:01:06.062 --> 00:01:08.314
even if they're sometimes in opposition.

00:01:08.356 --> 00:01:10.399
This is the nature of a dilemma.

00:01:10.441 --> 00:01:14.695
If one side prevails, the other side
will ultimately bring about defeat.

00:01:17.698 --> 00:01:18.908
Often in a dilemma,

00:01:18.908 --> 00:01:22.120
you’ll find a fixed value,
strongly protected

00:01:22.161 --> 00:01:26.165
and considered the foundation of success,
like short-term profit.

00:01:26.499 --> 00:01:29.418
We call this fundamental
priority the rock.